# Vite per-developer env overrides
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example
# `.env` was previously not ignored, so the working copy (which holds the
# Google OAuth client ID) was one `git add -A` away from being committed.
# `.env.dev` / `.env.prod` stay tracked deliberately — they carry no secrets.

